     "body": "My work asks a simple question: why do some streets get malaria and others don’t? With community researchers in Kano, Ibadan, and Enugu, I map housing, drainage, and rainfall, then test small changes families and councils can afford.\n\nI use household surveys, mosquito trapping, and satellite data — and I always share results with the communities first."
